msgstr "干し草ドローン"

msgid "DRONE"
msgstr "ドローン"

msgid "Digs the pile in a zone you choose and flies the hay to a drop point, up to %.0f m from its pad. Each one costs more than the last. Max %d."
msgstr ""

msgid "Place drone"
msgstr "ドローンを設置"

msgid "works the circle drawn on the ground"
msgstr "地面に描かれた円の中で働く"

msgid "Platform"
msgstr "足場"

msgid "DECK"
msgstr "足場"

msgid "$%d per m2"
msgstr "1m²あたり$%d"

msgid "A floor you can walk on. Click two corners."
msgstr "上を歩ける床。角を2か所クリックする。"

msgid "Start corner"
msgstr "最初の角を置く"

msgid "Place deck"
msgstr "足場を設置"

msgid "Stair"
msgstr "階段"

msgid "STAIR"
msgstr "階段"

msgid "$%d per metre of rise"
msgstr "高さ1mあたり$%d"

msgid "Climbs from the floor to a deck. Click the deck edge it comes off, then the spot on the ground it lands on."
msgstr "床から足場へ上る階段。まず階段をつける足場のふちをクリックして、次に地面の降り口をクリック。"

msgid "Start on deck edge"
msgstr "足場のふちから始める"

msgid "Land stair"
msgstr "階段を下ろす"

msgid "Wall"
msgstr "壁"

msgid "WALL"
msgstr "壁"

msgid "A solid steel wall, %.1f m tall. Built in %.0f m sections."
msgstr "高さ%.1fmのがんじょうな鉄の壁。%.0fmずつ建てる。"

msgid "Start wall"
msgstr "壁の始点を置く"

msgid "Place wall"
msgstr "壁を設置"

msgid "Window Wall"
msgstr "窓付きの壁"

msgid "WINDOW"
msgstr "窓"

msgid "A wall with a %.1f m hole in each section. Hay, belts and people can go through."
msgstr "区画ごとに%.1fmの穴があいた壁。干し草もベルトも人も通れる。"

msgid "Doorway"
msgstr "出入口"

msgid "DOOR"
msgstr "出入口"

msgid "One wall section with a %.1f m doorway. Snaps into a wall you already built."
msgstr "幅%.1fmの出入口がある壁1区画。建ててある壁にぴったりはまる。"

msgid "Start doorway"
msgstr "出入口の始点を置く"

msgid "Place doorway"
msgstr "出入口を設置"

msgid "Roof"
msgstr "屋根"

msgid "ROOF"
msgstr "屋根"

msgid "A flat roof, built in %.0f m sections along the top of a wall. Reaches %.0f m in."
msgstr "壁の上に%.0fmずつ建てる平らな屋根。内側へ%.0fmまで届く。"

msgid "Start roof"
msgstr "屋根の始点を置く"

msgid "Place roof"
msgstr "屋根を設置"

msgid "Other side"
msgstr "反対側"

msgid "Angled Roof"
msgstr "傾斜屋根"

msgid "PITCH"
msgstr "傾斜"

msgid "A sloped roof that rises %.1f m. Two of them facing each other across a %.0f m building meet in the middle."
msgstr "高さ%.1fmまで上がる斜めの屋根。幅%.0fmの建物に向かい合わせで2枚置くと、真ん中でぴったり合う。"

msgid "Slope the other way"
msgstr "傾きを逆にする"

msgid "Roof Hatch"
msgstr "屋根ハッチ"

msgid "HATCH"
msgstr "ハッチ"

msgid "$%d per bay"
msgstr "1区画$%d"

msgid "A roof section with a %.1f m hole and a ladder. Use it to get onto the roof."
msgstr "%.1fmの穴とはしごがついた屋根の区画。屋根に上るときに使う。"

msgid "Place hatch"
msgstr "ハッチを設置"

msgid "Turn the hatch"
msgstr "ハッチを回す"

msgid "lines itself up with the bays either side"
msgstr "両どなりの区画に自動でそろう"

msgid "Railing"
msgstr "手すり"

msgid "RAIL"
msgstr "手すり"

msgid "A railing along the edge of a platform."
msgstr "足場のふちにつける手すり。"

msgid "Start rail"
msgstr "手すりの始点を置く"

msgid "Place rail"
msgstr "手すりを設置"

msgid "Belt Splitter"
msgstr "ベルト分岐器"

msgid "SPLIT"
msgstr "分岐"

msgid "$%d"
msgstr "$%d"

msgid "Splits one belt into two, one load each way."
msgstr "1本のベルトを2本に分ける。荷は1つずつ交互に流れる。"

msgid "Place splitter"
msgstr "分岐器を設置"

msgid "snaps to the end of a belt run"
msgstr "ベルトの端にくっつく"

msgid "Compact Splitter"
msgstr "コンパクト分岐器"

msgid "3 WAY"
msgstr "3分岐"

msgid "Splits one belt evenly across three outputs."
msgstr "1本のベルトを3つの出口に均等に分ける。"

msgid "Place compact splitter"
msgstr "コンパクト分岐器を設置"

msgid "snaps to an open or covered belt end"
msgstr "むき出しでもカバー付きでも、ベルトの端にくっつく"

msgid "Smart Splitter"
msgstr "スマート分岐器"

msgid "SMART"
msgstr "スマート"

msgid "Routes items by type, with undefined and overflow rules."
msgstr "アイテムを種類ごとに振り分ける。指定のないものやあふれた分の行き先も決められる。"

msgid "Place smart splitter"
msgstr "スマート分岐器を設置"

msgid "U Splitter"
msgstr "U字分岐器"

msgid "U SPLIT"
msgstr "U分岐"

msgid "Splits one belt into two belts side by side, going the same way."
msgstr "1本のベルトを、同じ向きに並んだ2本のベルトに分ける。"

msgid "Place U splitter"
msgstr "U字分岐器を設置"

msgid "T Junction"
msgstr "T字ジャンクション"

msgid "T JUNCT"
msgstr "T字"

msgid "Sets itself up from its belts: one belt in splits into two, two belts in join into one."
msgstr "つないだベルトで動きが決まる。入るベルトが1本なら2本に分けて、2本なら1本にまとめる。"

msgid "Place T junction"
msgstr "T字ジャンクションを設置"

msgid "snaps to a belt end  ·  R picks which end the belt goes in"
msgstr "ベルトの端にくっつく  ·  Rでベルトが入る側を選ぶ"

msgid "Belt Joiner"
msgstr "ベルト合流器"

msgid "JOIN"
msgstr "合流"

msgid "Merges two belts into one, one load from each in turn."
msgstr "2本のベルトを1本にまとめる。それぞれから1つずつ交互に流す。"

msgid "Place joiner"
msgstr "合流器を設置"

msgid "snaps a belt onto the side you face away from"
msgstr "向いているのと反対側にベルトがくっつく"

msgid "U Joiner"
msgstr "U字合流器"

msgid "U JOIN"
msgstr "U合流"

msgid "Merges two side by side belts into one."
msgstr "並んだ2本のベルトを1本にまとめる。"

msgid "Place U joiner"
msgstr "U字合流器を設置"

msgid "snaps to the end of a belt run on the side you aim at"
msgstr "ねらった側のベルトの端にくっつく"

msgid "Haystack Scanner"
msgstr "干し草スキャナー"

msgid "SCANNER"
msgstr "スキャナー"

msgid "Checks everything on a belt for needles and keeps them in its drawer. The Mk I stops the belt until you empty it."
msgstr "ベルトの上のものを全部調べて、見つけた針を引き出しにしまう。Mk Iは引き出しを空にするまでベルトを止める。"

msgid "Place scanner"
msgstr "スキャナーを設置"

msgid "Hay Compressor"
msgstr "干し草圧縮機"

msgid "PRESS"
msgstr "圧縮"

msgid "Presses %d strands into a bale worth %.1fx loose hay."
msgstr "干し草%d本をぎゅっと固めてベールにする。値段はばらの干し草の%.1f倍。"

msgid "Place compressor"
msgstr "圧縮機を設置"

msgid "Hay Wrapper"
msgstr "ベールラッパー"

msgid "WRAP"
msgstr "ラップ"

msgid "Wraps bales. Takes bales only, so put it after a compressor. Wrapped bales sell for %.2fx a bale."
msgstr "ベールをラップで包む。ベールしか受けつけないので、圧縮機の先に置こう。ラップベールはふつうのベールの%.2f倍で売れる。"

msgid "Place wrapper"
msgstr "ラッパーを設置"

msgid "Hay Pulper"
msgstr "干し草パルパー"

msgid "PULP"
msgstr "パルプ"

msgid "Place pulper"
msgstr "パルパーを設置"

msgid "Paper Mill"
msgstr "製紙機"

msgid "PAPER"
msgstr "製紙"

msgid "Place paper mill"
msgstr "製紙機を設置"

msgid "Feed Disc Press"
msgstr "飼料ディスクプレス"

msgid "DISCS"
msgstr "ディスク"

msgid "Presses hay from one belt and eco bricks from another into feed discs worth %.2fx the hay. Uses %d straw and %d bricks a disc and stops if either belt runs out. Any size of brick counts as one brick. It is %d m long with an input on the side, so leave room beside it. Uses %.1f kW."
msgstr "片方のベルトの干し草と、もう片方のベルトのエコブリックを押し固めて、干し草の%.2f倍の値段の飼料ディスクにする。ディスク1枚に干し草%d本とブリック%d個を使い、どちらかのベルトが空になると止まる。ブリックは大きさに関係なく1個と数える。長さは%dmで横に投入口があるから、となりを空けておこう。電力を%.1fkW使う。"

msgid "Place feed disc press"
msgstr "飼料ディスクプレスを設置"

msgid "snaps to a belt; run the second belt to the side input after"
